{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾一款此前未曾正式發佈的新處理器酷睿Ultra 7 260K近日悄然上架銷售，但目前僅搭載於北美電商平台新蛋（Newegg）旗下自有品牌ABS的兩款遊戲整機中。其中，配置RTX 5060顯卡的Kaze II Aqua整機售價為1699.99美元，配備RTX 5070顯卡的Flux II Aqua整機售價則為1999.99美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586344.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.988192+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:35:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"bed24cea3ca750bd3e01f8241a542122eb17945b227c666fd77b7700ec1a2dc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}